{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772643469,"nonce":"O9IMWlZoKVFzI/NW/AaG7XA+Nog=","title":"Double \"Structure\" heading in ComponentLibrary sidebar","message":"The sidebar renders two \"Structure\" section headers because `withoutPinned` only filters out `name === \"Subgraph\"`. `PenzaiSubgraph` (category=Structure) bleeds through into `otherCategories[\"Structure\"]`, causing a second Structure section header below the pinned Structure section.\n\n## Root cause\n`web/src/components/panels/ComponentLibrary.tsx` line 122:\n```ts\nconst withoutPinned = filtered.filter((component) =\u003e component.name !== \"Subgraph\");\n```\nShould also filter `PenzaiSubgraph` and `AcausalSystem` (all subgraph types), not just `Subgraph`.\n\n## Fix\nExpand the `coreComponents` filter and `withoutPinned` filter to cover all three subgraph types.","files":null}]}